"THE TRIAL STORE CARRIES THE WRITTEN ROW WHERE EVERY READER LOOKS (2026-09-09). Message uses Dash is prohibited and the store holds no such row; the create that adds one answers the prohibition's verdict in its own violations, because the trial it validates carries the row as the population's own cell. And a fact whose fillers do not match the fact type's roles is malformed, 400, where it used to reach the uniqueness check with a row too short to index.",
