"AN APP WITH NO AUTH CONTEXT PERMITS EVERY OPERATION, AND PERMISSION IS INHERENT TO THE USER (Sam, 2026-09-09). The links are a ticket at A with advance and close. A store that designates nothing offers all three to anyone. A store whose app designates `User is authorized` offers all three to the login it names, nothing to another login, and nothing to the empty caller. A store designating the three-role grant offers exactly the link whose operation and resource the grant names: close on Ticket, and not the nav pair, whose operation is GET.",
