"THE VALUE-RESTRICTED PROJECTION'S RECIPE, AS THE ORACLE NOW EMITS IT (2026-09-09). `+ Admin is authorized for Operation 'create' on Protected Resource 'Support Request' iff Admin has Team Role` is a projection of the body's first column with two constant columns after it: proj, then a pairwith per literal, in head-role order. `+ Feature Request has GitHub Issue State 'open' iff Feature Request has Lifecycle Status 'Proposed'` restricts the body first: sel on the literal's role, then proj, then the head's constant. And when a constant precedes a projected role, a closing proj puts the columns in head order. These are the three shapes RecordValProjRecipe writes; canon evaluates each without a new form.",
