"AND A FILLER CAN SKIP A ROLE. Prefix matching could restrict roles 1..n and could never ask about role 2 alone -- which agents hold 555-0200 was unaskable, and that is half the questions worth asking of a binary. An EMPTY filler element is the wildcard. The last case is the guard: a wildcard in EVERY position restricts nothing and must answer the whole population, not none of it.",
