"AND THE SUBSET CONSTRAINTS ARE CHECKED. state:setcmp carried nine of them with NO READER -- emitted for a leg-filling mechanism that the corrected matcher replaced -- and this is the reader. It is the tollens direction of the same implication the matcher uses forwards: sub contained in super, so a value in the sub leg absent from the super leg is a violation. The MODALITY decides the tag and therefore the gate: an alethic subset tags subset and refuses the commit, a deontic one tags deontic and warns. Same check, same data, opposite consequence.",
